{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026W2T1LYDHiJ1794435816.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲。日間部分時間有陽光及乾燥，最高氣溫約27度。吹和緩東至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日稍後至星期六初時有驟雨，星期六稍後及星期日短暫時間有陽光。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:05:52.511903+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T22:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:19:42.860763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T22:59:03.484472+00:00","content_hash":"05f94f356dd9eeff084650cef6c8bf44ccafb687451137120273fc84d642ddf4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}